# IDEs
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Graph engine
# Note: graph/export/ is NOT ignored — the committed backup is reviewed in diffs.
.venv/
.env
graph/reports/

# LLM tooling — settings stay local, but skills are project artifacts
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/

# Proposal rounds: archives are the durable trail; current/ is working state
graph/proposals/current/
# Branch lines of truth: each branch's export, applied.log, and round
# archives are the durable trail; only its current/ is working state
graph/branches/*/proposals/current/

# The trace checker stays local-only (owner ruling): its banned list is
# itself a dictionary of the source domain, so it runs as a pre-push
# habit, never as committed content.
/tools/no_trace.py
/tests/test_no_trace.py
